title: Questions of Ideology
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: ideology_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; old_ideology = ideology; ideology_timer = 18
card-image: img/graphics/the_cooperative_commonwealth.jpg
max-visits: 3
#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The [+ party_names.ccf +] is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @class_struggle: We must return to a purely Socialist movement, aimed at the creation of a true Cooperative Commonwealth. 
- @managerial: Our main goal should be smart, pragmatic management and gradual transformation 
- @agrarian: The plight of the farmers will be our calling.
- @labour: We should work with the trade unions to improve the lives of workers.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
subtitle: Increased support for Socialism
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; ccf_socialism += 10; left_dissent -= 5; pps_relation -= 3; pcps_relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1; cpc_s_relation += 3

[? if ccf_socialism <= 50 : The road to Socialism seems a long one and many are not quite convinced that a true economic transformation is the way to either maintain the relevancy of our progressive party or to ensure a continual rise in the standard of living observed under our traditional middle-of-the-road policies. ?]

[? if ccf_socialism > 50 :  Our continued campaigning for Socialism seems to have paid dividends as the party members are convinced that a new direction leftward will enable our party to truly enact lasting change in this province. ?]


@managerial
subtitle: The Managerial Wing will be pleased. 
on-arrival: managerial_strength += 5; 

The Managerial wing of the party supports top-down economic planning with a focus on balanced budgets. 

@agrarian
subtitle: The Agrarian-Cooperativists will be pleased.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "agrarian") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "agrarian"; agrarian_strength += 10; agrarian_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; managerial_dissent -= 5

Agrarian-Cooperativism increases rural support and raises expectations of benefits to the cooperatives. 

@labour
subtitle: The Labour Wing will be pleased. 
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "labour") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "labour"; wtb_support += 1; labour_dissent -= 5; cpc_s_relation -= 3

The labour wing of the party supports public works programs and the expansion of labour rights. 

@changed
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; agrarian_dissent += 5; labour_dissent += 5; managerial_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.